#
#     git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
#
# Only add a commit here if it is genuinely a no-op for the reader — a
# reformat, a rename, a line-ending pass. Never a commit that also changed
# behaviour, or the real change becomes invisible to blame.

